{"page":234,"verses":[{"verse_key":"11:109","surah":11,"ayah":109,"ar_uthmani":"فَلَا تَكُ فِى مِرْيَةٍ مِّمَّا يَعْبُدُ هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ ۚ مَا يَعْبُدُونَ إِلَّا كَمَا يَعْبُدُ ءَابَآؤُهُم مِّن قَبْلُ ۚ وَإِنَّا لَمُوَفُّوهُمْ نَصِيبَهُمْ غَيْرَ مَنقُوصٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], have no doubt about what these people worship: it is merely what their fathers worshipped before them, and We shall certainly give them their share in full, without any reduction.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"So (do) not","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"11:109"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَكُ","en_gloss":"be","transliteration":"taku","verse_key":"11:109"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"11:109"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِرْيَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"doubt","transliteration":"mir'yatin","verse_key":"11:109"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِّمَّا","en_gloss":"as to what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"11:109"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَعْبُدُ","en_gloss":"worship","transliteration":"yaʿbudu","verse_key":"11:109"},{"pos":7,"ar":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ ۚ","en_gloss":"these (polytheists)","transliteration":"hāulāi","verse_key":"11:109"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"11:109"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَعْبُدُونَ","en_gloss":"they worship","transliteration":"yaʿbudūna","verse_key":"11:109"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"11:109"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَمَا","en_gloss":"as what","transliteration":"kamā","verse_key":"11:109"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَعْبُدُ","en_gloss":"worshipped","transliteration":"yaʿbudu","verse_key":"11:109"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ءَابَآؤُهُم","en_gloss":"their forefathers","transliteration":"ābāuhum","verse_key":"11:109"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"11:109"},{"pos":15,"ar":"قَبْلُ ۚ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"qablu","verse_key":"11:109"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَإِنَّا","en_gloss":"And indeed, We","transliteration":"wa-innā","verse_k